# Git LFS — learning-set training data (added 2026-07-31, per Luba's directive).
#
# Scope: THIS folder + its subfolders ONLY. Small config/fixture JSONs elsewhere in
# the repo are unaffected (this is a folder-scoped .gitattributes, mirroring the
# repo's existing in-folder LFS pattern under "internal learnin 2/...").
#
# Guarantee: the dataset lives at the DIRECT, visible path
#   llm mvp/learning-sets/<name>.json
# Its bytes are stored via LFS — a committed pointer at that direct path + the blob
# pushed to GitHub LFS. Never gitignored, never left only in a hidden/uncommitted place.
*.json  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# Safety net: batch training data is often JSONL, and this repo already LFS-tracks
# .jsonl elsewhere. Delete the next line if you want strictly .json under LFS here.
*.jsonl filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
